Actually, I prefer to stick to cave spiders and violet fungi till I gain
the intrinsic.  The only drawback to this is that you've gotta eat a LOT
of cave spiders before you find that special one that confers the
intrinsic, and you have to go a little lower in the dungeon to find the
Fungi.  But I'd rather spend a little time hallucinating because of the
fungi than wander around without enough strength to wear any decent
armor.

